WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.585 --> 00:00:16.166
was so hungry and tired, she drifted off to sleep quickly.

2
00:00:17.447 --> 00:00:19.388
She did not know how long she slept.

3
00:00:20.728 --> 00:00:23.609
She also did not know what woke her up in the middle of the night.

4
00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:25.870
It had been a noise.

5
00:00:26.571 --> 00:00:29.632
The skylight had made a small click as it closed.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.723
Now a man dressed in white crouched on the roof and secretly watched Sara.

7
00:00:37.285 --> 00:00:40.567
At first when Sara woke up, she did not open her eyes.

8
00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:42.868
She felt too sleepy.

9
00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:46.951
Strangely enough, she also felt warm and comfortable.

10
00:00:46.971 --> 00:00:51.394
"I must be dreaming," she murmured.

11
00:00:51.414 --> 00:00:54.256
"This is such a nice dream.

12
00:00:55.017 --> 00:00:56.498
I'll keep my eyes closed.

13
00:00:57.859 --> 00:00:59.000
I don't want to wake up."

14
00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:03.634
Sara thought that warm blankets were heaped upon her bed.

15
00:01:04.955 --> 00:01:07.717
She reached out her hand and touched a down quilt.

16
00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:11.520
Then she heard a fire crackling.

17
00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:15.463
"Oh, this is so lovely."

18
00:01:16.563 --> 00:01:18.184
She squeezed her eyes tighter.

19
00:01:18.204 --> 00:01:21.387
"I must make this dream last."

20
00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:24.349
But she kept waking up.

21
00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:28.952
Sara finally opened her eyes and looked around her room.

22
00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:33.973
To her astonishment she saw a real fire glowing in the fireplace.

23
00:01:35.414 --> 00:01:37.594
A brass kettle was bubbling and hissing.

24
00:01:38.794 --> 00:01:41.115
There was a thick red rug on the floor.

25
00:01:42.375 --> 00:01:45.256
In front of the fire stood a small table and chair.

26
00:01:46.557 --> 00:01:49.577
Upon the table were several covered dishes and a teapot.

27
00:01:50.738 --> 00:01:54.179
A bright lamp with a pink shade gave the room a rosy glow.

28
00:01:56.179 --> 00:01:58.360
Sara's bed was covered with new blankets.

29
00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:04.194
At the foot of the bed were a red silk robe, a pair of slippers, and some books.

30
00:02:05.295 --> 00:02:07.376
It looked to Sara like a fairyland.

31
00:02:07.396 --> 00:02:10.097
"This can't be real!"

32
00:02:10.517 --> 00:02:11.237
said Sara.

33
00:02:11.257 --> 00:02:15.239
"I'm getting out of bed now, but I must still be dreaming.

34
00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.540
Yet everything looks real!"

35
00:02:20.681 --> 00:02:24.163
She stepped near the blazing fire and spread out her hands.

36
00:02:24.183 --> 00:02:26.324
"It's hot!

37
00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:29.270
A fire in a dream wouldn't be hot!"

38
00:02:31.051 --> 00:02:35.534
Sara dashed around the room, touching the table, the dishes, the rug.

39
00:02:38.296 --> 00:02:40.798
She picked up the red robe and held it to her cheek.

40
00:02:40.818 --> 00:02:42.639
"It's warm!

41
00:02:43.259 --> 00:02:44.140
It's soft!"

42
00:02:44.841 --> 00:02:45.941
She almost sobbed.

43
00:02:47.142 --> 00:02:48.123
"It's all real.

44
00:02:48.883 --> 00:02:49.804
It must be!"

45
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.048
She put on the robe and stepped into the slippers.

46
00:02:56.288 --> 00:02:57.289
"They're real too!

47
00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.452
I am not—I am not dreaming!"

48
00:03:03.273 --> 00:03:05.334
Sara almost staggered to the books.

49
00:03:07.716 --> 00:03:12.760
She opened the one on top of the pile and found a message: To the little girl in

50
00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.280
the attic.

51
00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:14.461
From a friend.

52
00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:18.684
She put her face down on the page and burst into tears.

53
00:03:18.704 --> 00:03:24.588
"I don't know who it is, but somebody cares about me.

54
00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.701
I have a friend."

55
00:03:29.543 --> 00:03:32.285
Sara took her candle and slipped into Becky's room.

56
00:03:35.347 --> 00:03:37.148
She stood quietly by Becky's bed.

57
00:03:37.168 --> 00:03:39.630
"Becky! Becky!

58
00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:40.571
Wake up!"

59
00:03:41.051 --> 00:03:42.852
she whispered as loudly as she dared.

60
00:03:43.993 --> 00:03:46.435
Startled out of sleep, Becky sat upright.

61
00:03:47.616 --> 00:03:49.557
Her face was still smudged with tears.

62
00:03:50.738 --> 00:03:53.760
She was frightened until she realized Sara had awoken her.

63
00:03:54.656 --> 00:03:59.560
Dressed in a beautiful red robe and holding a candle, Sara looked like a princess.

64
00:04:00.701 --> 00:04:02.703
"Come with me," said Sara.

65
00:04:02.723 --> 00:04:05.165
"Becky, you must come at once."

66
00:04:06.286 --> 00:04:08.448
Becky was still too dazed to speak.

67
00:04:10.389 --> 00:04:15.133
She simply got up and followed Sara, her mouth and eyes wide open.

68
00:04:17.896 --> 00:04:22.520
When they reached Sara's room, Sara pulled Becky into the warm, glowing room.

69
00:04:24.224 --> 00:04:25.985
Becky could not believe her eyes.

70
00:04:26.945 --> 00:04:29.707
She blinked and asked, "Is it real, miss?"

71
00:04:30.887 --> 00:04:31.767
Sara nodded.

72
00:04:31.787 --> 00:04:33.108
"It's real!"

73
00:04:33.548 --> 00:04:34.048
she said.

74
00:04:34.068 --> 00:04:38.290
"I've touched everything, and it's all as real as we are.

75
00:04:39.451 --> 00:04:42.232
Something magical has happened while we slept."

76
00:04:45.233 --> 00:04:50.256
For the rest of the night, the two girls sat by the fire and enjoyed a hot, tasty

77
00:04:50.316 --> 00:04:54.369
meal. The covered dishes contained delicious soup.

78
00:04:55.349 --> 00:04:59.450
There were also sandwiches, muffins, and tea for both of them.

79
00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.631
Becky sipped the tea with pleasure.

80
00:05:03.651 --> 00:05:07.952
It was so delicious, it was not necessary to pretend it was anything but tea!

81
00:05:07.972 --> 00:05:14.234
"I don't know anyone who could have done this for me," Sara murmured.

82
00:05:14.254 --> 00:05:18.035
"Whoever it is, Becky, I have a friend."

83
00:05:18.055 --> 00:05:20.856
"Do you think it could all disappear?"

84
00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.361
asked Becky.

85
00:05:22.381 --> 00:05:25.062
"Maybe we should eat quickly."

86
00:05:25.522 --> 00:05:27.383
She crammed a sandwich into her mouth.

87
00:05:28.464 --> 00:05:31.206
"No, it won't disappear," Sara replied.

88
00:05:31.226 --> 00:05:32.826
"Take your time."

89
00:05:34.307 --> 00:05:36.849
The girls slowly ate their meal while they talked.

90
00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:41.912
Soon they felt warm, happy, and sleepy.

91
00:05:44.073 --> 00:05:49.176
When it was time to go back to bed, Sara realized that she had more than enough blankets.

92
00:05:52.748 --> 00:05:53.369
"Here, Becky.

93
00:05:53.829 --> 00:05:56.292
Take some blankets for your bed," she said.

94
00:05:56.312 --> 00:05:58.374
"Oh, thank you, miss!"

95
00:05:58.935 --> 00:05:59.596
Becky said.

96
00:06:00.777 --> 00:06:01.978
Becky got ready to go.

97
00:06:02.679 --> 00:06:05.262
At the door she turned for one last look at the room.

98
00:06:05.282 --> 00:06:07.945
"It's so beautiful!"

99
00:06:08.546 --> 00:06:09.046
she said.

100
00:06:09.066 --> 00:06:13.872
"If it all disappears tomorrow, I don't want to forget any of it."
